      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "See you so excited (Mm)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You got him locked down (Mmh, yeah)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You're movin' like I did (Mm)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Before I found out",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "He ain't just a pretty-faced talker",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Good with his money, close to his mother",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You're seein' one-sided (Sided)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "You got him right now",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "And she be like, \"He's so perfect\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I be like, \"Oh, what version?\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "\"Ain't nobody got me this nervous\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Oh, baby, I been there (Hey)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And right in that same position (Hey)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "So, baby, don't get this twisted (Hey)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "No, nothin' could make me miss it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Take him, he's yours",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
